    "Do you really want to delete all your data? Your scores will also be removed from the online ranking." : {
      "comment" : "ローカルスコアの全削除の確認アラートの本文。",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Do you really want to delete all your data? Your scores will also be removed from the online ranking."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "すべてのデータを削除しますか？オンラインランキングの記録も削除します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your name and scores will be removed from the online ranking, and your user name will be cleared. Nothing is sent to the ranking until you set a user name again." : {
      "comment" : "ランキングから削除する前の確認アラートの本文。",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your name and scores will be removed from the online ranking, and your user name will be cleared. Nothing is sent to the ranking until you set a user name again."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "オンラインランキングから名前と点数を削除し、ユーザー名も消します。もう一度ユーザー名を設定するまで、ランキングには何も送りません。"
